# Tracked artifacts still present (NOT untracked by design).
# Owner decision required before any `git rm --cached`:
#   - Program/                              (tracked binaries, ClickOnce setup, Program/RealVision-Lab/*.exe/*.dll)
#   - degerler.txt                          (tracked production scan log)
#   - Program/RealVision-Lab/debug.txt      (tracked runtime log)
#   - Program/RealVision-Lab/Values/*.txt   (tracked runtime values; matched by **/Values/ but still tracked)
